SUMMARY:Special Event: Lauren Lapkus & Mary Holland
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Best friends\, Lauren Lapkus & Mary Holland\, invite you to an 
 evening of improvisation based on shared stories.\n\nLAUREN LAPKUS is an Em
 my-nominated actress\, writer\, and comedian currently starring in the inau
 gural season of STUART FAILS TO SAVE THE UNIVERSE for HBO Max\, in which sh
 e reprises her role of Denise from THE BIG BANG THEORY. She previously garn
 ered recognition when she burst onto the scene as prison guard Susan Fische
 r on Netflix's ORANGE IS THE NEW BLACK\, for which she won a SAG award. She
  was nominated for an Emmy for her role of Samantha Newman on Funny Or Die'
 s THE EARLIEST SHOW and has created and starred in her own episode of THE C
 HARACTERS for Netflix. Lapkus was also one of Variety's 10 Comics To Watch 
 in 2016. Lapkus’ improv podcast\, WITH SPECIAL GUEST LAUREN LAPKUS\, debu
 ted at #1 on the comedy section of iTunes. She and Jon Gabrus co-hosted the
  popular 90s nostalgia podcast\, RAISED BY TV\, and she currently hosts the
  podcasts THREEDOM with Scott Aukerman and Paul F. Tompkins and NEWCOMERS w
 ith Nicole Byer. She toured throughout the United States and Australia as p
 art of the “Comedy Bang! Bang!” live tour in 2016.\n\nMARY HOLLAND can 
 currently be seen in the CBS series GHOSTS opposite Rose McIver and Utkarsh
  Ambudkar. She stars in the independent feature UNDER THE LIGHTS in the rol
 e of Kelly. She stars in the Hulu feature SELF-RELIANCE opposite Anna Kendr
 ick and Jake Johnson. She also stars in the critically acclaimed Apple+ ser
 ies BIG DOOR PRIZE from SCHITT’S CREEK producer David West Read. She will
  next be seen opposite Amy Adams in the Annapurna feature NIGHTBITCH from d
 irector Marielle Heller. Holland recently starred in the hit Netflix film S
 ENIOR YEAR opposite Rebel Wilson from mega comedy producer Todd Garner. Las
 t year\, Mary starred opposite Kristen Bell in the Netflix mini-series THE 
 WOMAN IN THE HOUSE. She also recently wrapped the John Slattery-directed fe
 ature MAGGIE MOORE(S) opposite Jon Hamm and Tina Fey. She received rave rev
 iews for…\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-
 event-lauren-lapkus-mary-holland/
